# Party banter: overheard, not joined. Speaker lines use the "Name:" prefix
# that Dialog_Conversation renders as a colored tag.
dialogue TSC_Banter_Gerald

== start ==
_You overhear Wren opening negotiations with Bran on behalf of a wall._

Wren: Twelve days alone in a ruin, and you named a wall.

Bran: Gerald held up his end better than most people I've traveled with.

Wren: Does Gerald get a verse?

Bran: Gerald gets a verse or I'm walking back there.

* [Leave them to it.] -> end
